le="font-family: 等线;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陈琦</span></p></td><td style="background: white;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 82pt;"><p style="font-family: 等线;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 等线;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">阳明中学</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（三）北门保安及志愿者</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">到场时间：13：50，北门。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">工作内容：</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.保安拦截社会考生的违禁物品，放在保管箱内，保管箱放在监控下方。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.引导社会考生至4105休息室及2楼安检门处安检。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.志愿者于6日下午13：45至考务办公室领取金属探测仪，用完后归还至考务室。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（四）视频监考、流动监考和考务组人员</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">视频监考和流动监考到场时间14：00，考务组人员到岗时间13：30。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人员：朱水军  马丹娜   王佩金   刘明玉   茹奕蓓   金笛  祝建强</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">单兴妹   商晶   王青（生活）  阮思嘉    陆海萍    俞金璐</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">冯王亮  马作菁   祝智浩   余栋材   赵正瑜   汪陈帅  张帆  胡建国  朱垭烨</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">工作内容：</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: -0.25in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-indent: 0;width: 0.250in;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">协助考生顺利完成演练，并反思总结修改二次安检流程。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: -0.25in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-indent: 0;width: 0.250in;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">阻止考生在进场铃响之前进入考场。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: -0.25in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-indent: 0;width: 0.250in;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">检查英语听力播放情况。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: -0.25in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-indent: 0;width: 0.250in;">4.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">听力试音结束后清理考场，尤其对有可能藏有手机区域仔细检查，待验收无误后封场，拉起警戒线。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="